@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - 006 Returning to an Activity and Closing the Room

actor Teacher
participant "Teacher Workspace\n(我的課堂活動)" as Workspace
participant "Teacher Console" as Console
participant "Teacher Activities Service" as Index
participant "Close Room Route" as CloseAPI
participant "Round Store (Lua)" as Store
database "Private Redis" as Redis
participant "Activity SSE" as Sync
actor Student
participant "Join / Open / Submit" as Guards

== Import records the activity ==
Teacher -> Workspace : Import Guided Notes
Workspace -> Redis : SET activity meta (createdAt, titles)\nZADD teacher:{id}:activities createdAt activityId; EXPIRE

== Teacher leaves the console and comes back ==
Teacher -> Console : (closes tab / presses back)
note over Redis, Student : Room state stays in Redis; open questions\nstay open and students keep answering.
Teacher -> Workspace : rail 教師工作區
Workspace -> Index : listTeacherActivities(session teacher)
Index -> Redis : ZREVRANGE 0..49 + MGET activity metas
alt An activity meta has expired
  Index -> Redis : ZREM expired ids
end
Index --> Workspace : summaries (ongoing first, newest first)
Teacher -> Workspace : click the activity
Workspace -> Console : /teacher/activities/{id}
Console -> Sync : EventSource (snapshot + live events)

== Close the room ==
Teacher -> Console : 關閉房間
Console --> Teacher : in-page confirm (N open questions will end)
Teacher -> Console : 確認關閉房間
Console -> CloseAPI : POST /api/activities/{id}/close
CloseAPI -> Store : closeActivity(activity, teacher)
Store -> Redis : GET activity meta (open round ids)
Store -> Redis : EVAL close-rounds.lua mode end-activity
alt Not the owner
  Redis --> Store : FORBIDDEN
  Store --> CloseAPI : 403
else Already ended
  Redis --> Store : { phase: ended, rounds: [], alreadyEnded: true }
else A round was opened after the read
  Redis --> Store : STALE_OPEN_ROUNDS
  Store -> Redis : re-read and EVAL again (bounded retries)
else Close
  Redis -> Redis : close every open round (results.finalized each)\nphase = ended, endedAt, drop open map\nXADD activity.ended
  Redis --> Store : { phase: ended, endedAt, rounds, stateVersion }
end
Store --> CloseAPI : result
CloseAPI --> Console : 200 → board read-only (writeback kept)
Sync -> Redis : read events
Sync --> Console : results.finalized ..., activity.ended
Sync --> Student : results.finalized ..., activity.ended → 活動已結束

== After the room is closed ==
Student -> Guards : join with code / submit answer
Guards --> Student : 409 活動已關閉 / 此搶答回合已結束
Teacher -> Guards : open questions
Guards --> Teacher : 409 活動已關閉
Teacher -> Console : 回填 a closed question
Console -> Redis : enqueue writeback (allowed after ended)
@enduml
